Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ first-boot provisioning (updates, drivers, firmware, Flathub)
 After installation, once the machine is online, installs all pending updates,
 hardware drivers (ubuntu-drivers), firmware, free codecs and enables Flathub,
 then marks itself done. Runs in the background; never blocks login.
